  m_text: 'Now that you have a regular waffle, you can sell it! go ahead and sell
    it and watch your customer in.


    Watch and collect any possible leftovers
    and tips they may leave! it could make you money!


    These waffles can keep
    you afloat for a while, but you may need to make them fancier with something... '
