  m_text: "Ingredients can create more expensive waffles! \nBy buying a topping station
    in the managers office, you should be able to buy an ingredient to put on your
    waffle!.\n\nThe Topping station works similarly to the mixing station, you just
    have to tell the table when you are ready to top the waffle! "
